   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Rust Result<T, CargoError> <-> WIT result<t, cargo-error> <-> Go cm.Result[...]; Rust panic! and Go panic() both become the SAME trap at the boundary.",
